    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with her consent. She has no written directive. She named a health care agent, recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here. She said that what matters most to her is her work and being able to help people, and that she wants her health information kept private and shared only with the people she chooses. She chose not to record treatment preferences today and will revisit the directive at her next preventive visit. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
